# Conformance probe pack for ruling 5 of spec 0.18: a sequential `field`
# line with `with` and an `also` line (ruling 13 of 0.8). Public. No kinds.
# One byte: x with y, also z. When y is not held the line's own key is not a
# candidate, and z, the `also` key, stays one. The sentinel 255 is written
# only when the line is not suppressed and no key of it has a value; a
# suppressed line whose `also` keys give no value writes zero bits (ruling
# 20). y is mapped by no line of this pack.
format     conformance-cond-seq-also
version    0.18.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
field   probe.x  8  uint  absent 255  with probe.y
also    probe.z
